window.products.push({"id":625042,"name":"Gear Ultimate Moscow Mule Pure Copper Mug: 100% Solid Copper Cup, 16 Ounces, No Inner Linings, Perfect for Russian Moscow Mules, Cocktail and Cold Dri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v+Fw2ytXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"YOUR BEST CHOICE: Perfect for enhancing the flavor and keeping all your favorite drinks cold and refreshing, be it a russian moscow mule, whiskey, vodka, rum, margarita, tequila mixed drink, stinger, beer, infused water, iced coffee, iced tea and many more. Constructed of 100% solid pure copper, it has no stainless steel or nickel lining, which ensures it is contamination-free. These are not imitation copper plated mugs, nor are they lined with tin, nickel, steel, or food lacquer inner coatings. AMAZINGLY COLD, SUPER REFRESHING: This mug gets really cold and frosts up in seconds. Leave it in the freezer for a frosted mug effect and keep your drink colder for much longer. It makes your Moscow mules, or any drink for that matter, super refreshing. There's nothing more refreshing on a hot day, or any day. The pure copper ensures the proper chemical ionization of acids commonly found in citrus fruits for the perfect moscow mules. SUPERIOR VALUE: Bundle includes the Gear Ultimate Pure Copper Mug, the Gear Ultimate's Quick Cocktail Recipe downloadable ebook with awesome cocktail recipes you can make straight away, outstanding Gear Ultimate customer support, plus more Gear Ultimate ebooks on the way. TOP QUALITY & DESIGN: With a classic 16 oz size, it is the perfect size of a cup to hold in your hand. The cups of choice when serving the infamous Moscow Mule, a cocktail made from a blend of vodka, ginger beer, and lime juice. Handcrafted and polished to perfection, with a perfect 16 oz size for cocktails, this stunningly beautiful copper drinking cup makes an excellent gift for birthdays, weddings, anniversaries, or simply as a fun novelty addition to your current bar collection. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE: Your satisfaction is 100% guaranteed because we are not happy until you are happy! We are so confident that you are going to love your Gear Ultimate Pure Copper Mug that we offer a LIFETIME no-hassle guarantee from manufacturer defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v+Fw2ytXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gear Ultimate","source_asin":"B010WQKEA2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625042","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010WQKEA2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010WQKEA2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
