window.products.push({"id":625070,"name":"Shadow Box Display Case, Deep Shadow Box Frame, Wood Shadow Box with Linen Back, Memory Box (Black, 16x20)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yLniNcWVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Shadow Box is great for holding sports medals, awards, keepsakes, ticket stubs, wedding cards, sea shells, and other memorabilia. With its sleek, simple design, this wooden box frame is a thoughtful and striking way to add a creative, personal touch to your home's decor. Showcase your favorite scrapbook pages, photos or artwork with the deep shadow box frame. Shadow Box Specs: -Holds one 11x14\" image. Accommodates objects up to 1.1\" thick. -Linen display backboard, Back loading. -Hanging hardware is pre-attached.(2 seamless nails and 6 push pins) Display a cherished memory with FRAME YI shadow box frame. Use it to display and storage trinkets. Create your own small collections of items for a uniquely personal touch. This display box frame comes with a clear plexiglass insert to protect your collectiables.(Plexiglass front can easily be removed for an open shadowbox.) The wide border and simple design go well with a variety of decors and color schemes. Its clean lines suit the atmosphere of almost any home or office space, while the classic style makes this box frame comes ready to hang for your convenience.Can stand on a table, or can be wall mounted with included hangers. Backing can also be easily opened to arrange or remove items. Soft linen backboard for easy stick pin attachment of ribbons, photos, small items...If you prefer, you can easily cover linen with your own fabric or paper. You put a lot of time and effort into your passion for scrapbooking, it's time to show off your work! Shadowboxes are a great way to display photos, postcards and souvenirs from your favoriate vacations. Got a graduate? This shadow box will be a lovely way to showcase school pictures, graduation program and other mementos. It's also a thoughtful gift for wedding, mother's day, anniversary and for grandparents. Just uleash your creativity and put it on display!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yLniNcWVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRAME YI","source_asin":"B07MZNPMJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625070","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MZNPMJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MZNPMJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
