window.products.push({"id":625131,"name":"Vakkit Nonstick Frying Pan - Hard Anodized Aluminum with Anti-Warp Base, Stainless Steel Handle - Classic Nonstick Fry Skillet for Gas/Electric/Induct","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z0cKyELrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍳 COOK WITH IT FOR LONGER - Our nonstick pan is crafted from hard, anodized aluminum and features an anti-warp bottom. These allow our nonstick cookware to effectively stand up to the rigors of daily cooking. 🍳 SMART HEAT CONDUCTION - 5 mm high magnetic conductive stainless steel base allows our nonstick skillet suitable for all stove, including induction, glass & gas. Uniform heat distribution across surface, this quality minimizes unequal temperatures and hot spots. 🍳 EFFECTIVE & DURABLE COATING - VAKKIT fry pan features a 5 layer ultra-durable coating that is 5x harder, lasts 10x longer, and transfers heat 4x faster than traditional one, providing a better performance for easy food release & clean up, and better browning & searing,just wipe it with a paper towel or rinse it with water. 🍳 SAFE COOKING - This nonstick pan is 100% free of PFAS, PFOA, GenX, APEO, lead or cadmium. Stop worrying about harmful substances leaching into your food and harming your family's health. Great for busy families to keep meals as healthy and toxin-free as possible. 🍳 SAFE & STURDY HANDLE - Our hollowed-out triangular stainless steel handle minimizes heat build up to safe your hands from burns,staying cool during use. Double-riveted handles are especially designed for extra strength and secure handling in mind. 🍳 BEST GIFT FOR THE BEST YOU - This frying pan will be a perfect gift for mom, lover, family and friends forever. It is a best wish and unique and special gift idea and surprise for your special person as mother's day, birthday gifts, thanksgiving anniversary or any other occasion. 🍳 SMALL TIPS - Please put a small amount of oil in the pan to achieve a better non-stick effect. Don't let the pan boil dry or use excessive heat for too long as over heating may damage the pan and its non-stick properties. 🍳 SERVICE - We provides a 90-day money-back guarantee and free replacement within 6 months. In addition, we provides every customer with a lifetime service guarantee. We are here to offer you only the best quality products designed to make your life easier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z0cKyELrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vakkit","source_asin":"B09TNKSGXZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625131","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TNKSGXZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TNKSGXZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":625132,"name":"Full ChiliPad Cube - Single Zone - Heating and Cooling Pad - Fits Your Existing Mattress, Delivers Precise Temperature Control, and Creates the Perfec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jx9zxb1OL._AC_SL1377_.jpg","description":"The ChiliPad Cube is designed to help create the perfect sleep environment. By precisely regulating the mattress pad temperature and maintaining that temperature throughout the night, ChiliPad enables you to fall asleep more quickly, wake up feeling refreshed and able to maintain your energy levels throughout the day. ChiliPad Cube - Full The ChiliPad Cube Full Size cools or warms the bedding surface temperature for one person. Our innovative sleep technology creates the perfect sleep environment by actively circulating water through a network of micro-tubes to maintain your desired sleep temperature. Experience Deeper Sleep The ChiliPad Cube technology maintains your sleep temperature throughout the night so that you aren’t waking up freezing and reaching for blankets or sweating and trying to kick everything off. By regulating your sleep temperature, you can help your body maintain homeostasis and thereby experience deeper and more restorative sleep. Create the Perfect Sleep Environment ChiliPad Cube fits seamlessly on your current mattress ChiliPad Cube fits seamlessly on your current mattress You control your desired sleep temperature You control your desired sleep temperature ChiliPad Cube technology maintains the temperature throughout the mattress pad ChiliPad Cube technology maintains the temperature throughout the mattress pad Fall asleep faster Fall asleep faster Experience deeper and better sleep Experience deeper and better sleep Save money on your energy bill by regulating the temperature of the area you sleep in. Save money on your energy bill by regulating the temperature of the area you sleep in. 100% Satisfaction Guarantee The ChiliPad Cube comes with a 100% satisfaction guarantee. If you aren’t completely satisfied with your perfect sleep environment, we offer a full money back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jx9zxb1OL._AC_SL1377_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ChiliPad CUBE","source_asin":"B005504TMU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625132","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005504TMU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005504TMU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
