window.products.push({"id":625198,"name":"JONYJ 12 Pack Shoe Organizer, Clear Plastic Stackable Multifunctional Shoe Box, Universal Shoe Storage Boxes for Men and Women","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pmMqX8eFL._AC_SL1455_.jpg","description":"❥【STACKABLE IN MULTIPLE LAYERS】The simple snap interlocking system enables the shoe box to be stacked in multiple layers and the stacking is more secure, and the 360° rotation will not fall off, making it more secure when you take it. Not only that, but it can also help you save space to the greatest extent and keep your home neat and beautiful. If you're still struggling with cluttered shoes, try this 12-pack of stackable shoe boxes ❥【TRANSPARENT DESIGN】The clear window designed in the front door makes your shoes clearly visible, so you can quickly find and select the shoes you want to match your outfit for the day. If you are tired of struggling to find shoes in the piles, then this thoughtful transparent shoe organizer box will be a good choice to help you save time searching ❥【STURDT AND BREATHABLE】The shoes organizer are made of high-quality durable PP plastic, which is not easily deformed. At the same time, it also has a vent on the back to keep your shoes ventilated without odor. This is especially important if you live in a hot and humid climate ❥【APPLICABLE SIZE AND SCENARIO】This [13.2(L) x 9.4(W) x 5.9(H)] inch medium shoe organizer is suitable for men size 9 and women size 10, suitable for most shoe types: flat shoes, high heels , sneakers... to meet your basic needs. In addition, the applicable scenarios are also very wide. Clean, bright and tidy shoe organizer is a beautiful scenery no matter where you place it ❥【EASY INSTALLATION】The integrated easy-to-install design shoe box makes your installation more convenient and easier! It only takes four steps to easily assemble a shoe organizer. Compared with the tedious installation steps, this easy-to-install shoe organizer can bring you a great sense of satisfaction and achievement.It also comes with a deepened skeleton door handle design, which allows for ventilation, but also allows you to easily grab the handle and pick up shoes more easily","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pmMqX8eFL._AC_SL1455_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JONYJ","source_asin":"B0C5WPPPDV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625198","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5WPPPDV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5WPPPDV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
