window.products.push({"id":625222,"name":"Hompus 2.6Gal/10L Stainless Steel Small Trash Can with Lid Soft Close, Removable Inner Wastebasket, Slim Garbage Can for Bathroom Bedroom Office, Rect","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-EoF+DPnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Contemporary Addition to Any Home or Office: The slim rectangular profile shape makes the elegant and classic slim trash can great for any home or commercial areas. The smooth brushed stainless steel finish provides this luxurious, polished look which really adds to just about any and every decor. Silent Close Lid & Lid Stay-Open Mode: Lid shox technology makes the lid automatically, slowly and softly close with controlled closure, so it doesn't slam down and make a sound. Stay-open lid feature, the lid stays 90 degree open for as long as you like, perfect for longer chores. Dog Proof Trash Can & Odor-Free: The garbage can with lid prevents your small pets getting into the trash can and keeping them out of trash. The waste basket with lid covers up the smell of trash for a fresh, clean smelling home and healthier air. Removable Inner Bin: Removable interior liner bucket with a stainless steel handle lifts out for easy dumping garbage without using plastic trash bags and easy rinsing the whole garbage can. There is a convenient handle on the back of the metal trash can to move it easily. Anti-Fingerprint & Anti-Rust: This small garbage can boasts sturdy stainless steel construction for daily use. Brushed stainless steel finish is fingerprint-resistant, rust-resistant and smudge-resistant to keep the appearance clean and shinny. No matter what the style of the decoration, a classic stainless steel trash can is always the right choice. Durable Step Trash Can: Durable, ergonomic stainless steel pedal requires minimal force to open, it is designed to last over 150,000 steps – that’s more than 20 steps a day for over 20 years! The step design means you can operate the garbage bin hands-free. No Risk to Purchase: Hompus provides 1 year warranty and 30 days money back and lifetime customer service. If this soft close trash can you received is dented, damaged or the color is wrong, please feel free to send us an Amazon email, we will offer you a new garbage bin replacement or a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-EoF+DPnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hompus","source_asin":"B09MD1PCBS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625222","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MD1PCBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MD1PCBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
