window.products.push({"id":625277,"name":"ZonLi Cooling Memory Foam Pillow, 20\"x 26\" Side Sleeper Pillows, Standard Size Bed Pillows with Machine Washable Cover, Adjustable Loft Pillow for Bac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.34,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Y01ge2V4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cooling Pillow - ZonLi cooling pillow is made of 30% PE and 70% nylon with added jade powder to enhance its cooling properties. The Q-max value can reach 0.4. The memory foam is infused with gel to provide additional cooling effect. When used in conjunction with a fan or air conditioning, the cooling effect of the pillow can be extended. Adjustable - The pillow is designed to accommodate different sleeping positions. The filling is very plump, and the zipper design allows you to control the amount of filling needed for your best sleep. Whether you sleep on your back, side or stomach, this pillow can meet your needs. Perfect Proportion - ZonLi pillow is made of a combination of shredded memory foam and down alternative. After thousands of trials, the perfect proportion of these materials has been determined. Whether you want a soft or firm pillow, ZonLi pillow can accommodate your needs. 100% filling creates a firm pillow, 50% to 70% filling creates a soft and supportive pillow, and 30% filling creates a soft pillow. Adhere Body’s Curves - The memory foam follows the contours of the neck and head, closely adhering to the body's curves, releasing pressure and relieving pain. The excess memory foam should be removed to ensure that your head and body are aligned, providing you with comfortable and peaceful sleep. Care Instructions - The pillow cover has a zipper and can be removed for machine washing. The memory foam itself has a slight odor, which can be removed by airing out the inner core for 2-3 days and washing the outer cover. Every 3 months, the inner core should be manually kneaded to restore its optimal state.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Y01ge2V4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZonLi","source_asin":"B0BYJH53J3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYJH53J3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYJH53J3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
