window.products.push({"id":625319,"name":"MRUTYIU Bamboo Ziplock Bag Storage Organizer for Kitchen Drawer, Food Sandwich Storage Baggie Organizer and Ziplock Storage Bag Holders Suitable for G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fruQ8RYsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧀 [ 100% Natural Bamboo ] --- The bamboo drawer organizer for food storage bags adapts 100% environmental-friendly bamboo material, i t designed with finely polished by hand, no-odor, strong and durable. A perfect bamboo drawer organizer set decorates a healthy home life! 🍛[ 4 Divided Sections ] --- This bamboo food storage bag organizer holders is divided in 4 sized slots (1 Gallon box, 1 Quart box, 1 Sandwich box, 1 Snack box) which can provide separate space to organize different kind of goods bag. the product does not need to be assembled. just put the ziplock bag into the box according to the label display. 🥑[ Keep Kitchen Clean and Tidy ] --- Our bamboo ziplock bag organizer container for drawer is a ideal solution to free up your kitchen cabinet, drawer and countertop space! Perfect for home, kitchen, bathroom, and office drawer organization! Sort your snacks well and keep them clean and tidy. 🥦[ Compatible with Most Ziplock Bags ] --- The food bag storage organizer has an amazing capacity and can perfectly store most brands of sandwich bags, quart bags, snack bags, gallon bags. Not compatible with slider bags. Size:12” L x 12” W x 3” H. So please measure the size of your drawer in advance, avoid size discrepancies. 🍟[ Direct Use Without Installation ] --- The bag storage dispenser organizer box comes fully assembled. Just put the ziplock bag into the box according to the label display. With a cleaning cloth to remove the dirt on the surface. The more thoughtful open design makes the storage bags easier to put into,and won't cut your hands.Laser engraved letters that won't be rubbed off and no peeling labels.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fruQ8RYsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MRUTYIU","source_asin":"B09SFY63HM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SFY63HM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SFY63HM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":625320,"name":"Hallmark Keepsake Christmas Ornament 2022, Star Wars: The Mandalorian I'll See You Again","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Amx5qCAnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Following \"The Way\" of the Mandalorian code, Din Djarin seldom removes his helmet while in view of others. In a poignant display of vulnerability, the bounty hunter reveals his face for an emotional farewell as the foundling Grogu prepares to leave with Luke Skywalker to continue his Jedi training. This Christmas tree ornament captures that tender scene from the Disney+ original series \"Star Wars: The Mandalorian.\" With unparalleled artistry and exceptional detail, Hallmark Keepsake Christmas ornaments are perfect for preserving precious memories, commemorating special milestones and celebrating individual hobbies and interests. Hallmark has been your family-owned creator of greeting cards, Christmas ornaments, gifts, wrapping paper and more for over 100 years. We take deep pride in helping individuals connect in just the right way. © & ™ Lucasfilm Ltd.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Amx5qCAnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hallmark Keepsake","source_asin":"B0BPYB26CB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPYB26CB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPYB26CB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
