window.products.push({"id":625471,"name":"Ottomanson Studio Collection Mosaic Medallion Design Area Rug, 3'3\" X 5'0\", Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919Jh-yb3GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Revamp your dull spaces into areas of visual intrigue with our stylish Studio collection featuring colorful contemporary designs and the practicality of a stain-resistant, non-shedding soft pile completed with non-slip rubber backing. The Studio Collection promotes rugs and runner rugs that are both functional and decorative to contribute a trendy compliment to your space and home decor whilst preserving your floors from dirt, scratches, wear and tear. Sophisticate your space instantly and effortlessly when you roll out this stylish rug featuring an aesthetic mosaic design with mutiple entwined medallion motifs in the pastel hues of light and dark grey, beige and ivory composing a blend of traditional and fashionable flair. As an eye-catching piece, this high-quality yet budget-friendly rug will also create a focal point with simple yet classy mosaic design like an artwork for a unique look that will embellish the surrounding decor and furniture in your home or office. Resistant to fading, stains and shedding, this durable rug offers a fuss-free maintanence and can be an ideal choice for homes with kids and pets as well as heavy traffic areas like hallways, kitchens, entryways, living rooms. Machine-woven loop texture with 100% nylon pile makes this rug easy to lay flat and feels comfortable under your, your kids' and pets' feet; while the non-slip rubber backing helps with grip so your rug stays safely in place without moving even when you vacuum. Dense construction ensures durable and long-lasting service; and the utilitarian low-profile pile, made of premium quality nylon, provides stain and fade resistance as well as shed-free performance, which all make this rug suitable for even the most high-traffic areas at your house with breeze-like maintenance. Convert your house into a home with a finishing touch by simply setting one rug from this collection under your kitchen table, in your living room, hallways or by your foyer to greet your guests in a gracefully welcoming manner.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919Jh-yb3GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ottomanson","source_asin":"B06XZDTQ2S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XZDTQ2S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XZDTQ2S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
