window.products.push({"id":625543,"name":"Meli, Aluminum Metal Pizza Peel 12x14 inch Set, Pizza Paddle with Foldable Wooden Handle For Easy Storage, Stainless Steel Pizza Rocker Cutter, Gift f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E10OI+eZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mr Oliveto Foldable Aluminum Pizza Peel with foldable wooden handle is carefully crafted for the pizza maker, home chef and artisan baker. Designed with function and practicality in mind, the aluminum metal is made from commercial grade aluminum for durability and withstanding high temperatures. EASY TO STORE?You will not have to worry about the storage as this peel has a foldable handle hence saving space.?Features leather strap to showcase and hang pizza peel.It fits in any corner of the kitchen, pizza parlor or bakery.?The paddle is a perfect match for any kitchen decoration, gourmet pizza parlor and bakery.PERFECT SIZE?The Pizza Paddle with foldable wooden handle, measuring 12-inch wide by 14-inch long with a 12-inch foldable handle. The total length is 24-inch long when fully extended.The paddle has a enough surface area for holding your pizza.BETTER CHOICE(VS Wood Pizza Peels)?Aluminum is a popular pizza shovel material. It is easy to clean, durable, lightweight, and does not leave stains and odors.?Unlike pure wood peels, which are hard to clean, maintain and should be dried very well(otherwise mold, fungus and bacteria will grow on it).?Wood does require a bit more maintenance.Instructions For Use1.Turn the knob to loosen the screw and turn handle 180 Degree . Firmly tighten the handle.2. Sprinkle with flour,cornmeal,or milled wheat bran,to allow baked goods to easily slide on/off peel.3.Carefully place food onto a pizza stone, baking sheet or tray with the peel.4.Once finished cooking, slide out the pizza, bread or baked goods from the oven using the pizza peel paddle.5.Slice with precision using the rocker cutter.6.Serve and enjoy your creation!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E10OI+eZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Meli","source_asin":"B094L1TCPH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094L1TCPH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094L1TCPH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
