window.products.push({"id":625670,"name":"Osfvn Mercury Glass Pumpkins Light Timer Operated 5.5 Inches Halloween Pumpkin Decorations Fall Autumn Thanksgiving Home Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t1K4Drd9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Elegant Pumpkin Decoration】Pumpkin measures 5.7 Inches height and 5.5 Inches in diameter. It made of mercury glass, and the light is soft and warm through the exquisite leaves pattern. To decor your home with this beautiful pumpkin in fall and get several compliments from others. 【Happy Fall Decorations】Perfect outstanding decoration for Autumn, Halloween, Thanksgiving, Christmas. The Osfvn pumpkin decor can though the whole season holiday. And enjoy the season with the warm and sweet atmosphere bring from this adorable pumpkin. It will be suitable for living room decor, tabletop decorations, table centerpiece, fireplace decor, celebrating fall harvest events and so on. 【Convenient Timer Design】Designed with 6-hour on/ 18-hour off timer mode. It will run 6 hours and automatically turn off and after 18 hours this glass pumpkins lights will automatically turn on and keep repeating everyday until you turn it off. So you won't get bothered by constantly turning the light on and off every night. To reset the starting time, Firstly, turn off the pumpkins lights and turn on it at the time you want, then the pumpkin lights will start with the new time schedule. 【Batteries Operated】This pumpkin lights powered by 3 AAA batteries (batteries are not included). The working time of the pumpkin lantern depends on the power of the battery. Usually the working time can be last for up to 240 hours(about 40days). At the bottom of the pumpkin, it will be easily replaced the batteries via the tab. 【Grace Gifts】The Osfvn elegant pumpkin light decor is a nice gift for any one. It is a pretty gift for father, mother, families, friends, lover or the one you loved. It can be used at home, at banquets, in restaurants or the bar. It will be a wonderful decorations at parties, dates, and other fall celebratory events.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t1K4Drd9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Osfvn","source_asin":"B09ZY1HT6H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZY1HT6H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZY1HT6H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
