window.products.push({"id":625683,"name":"Alarm Day |Super Loud Analog Twin Bell Alarm Clock with Silent Ticking Sound |Stylish Vintage |398","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nAQlnZAaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Probably you don't find the need to get an old-school clock when you already have your smart phone that does the job for you. Here’s what you should know. According to sleep experts, you better buy an actual alarm clock and politely park your phone at the door. Remember, the Electromagnetic Fields can reduce your body’s production of melatonin that can lead to cancer and other diseases. Besides, what would you have done if your phone runs out of battery before the alarm rings? And, just admit it, most of the times, probably you just hit the ‘snooze’ button and sleep for another two hours. Just because it’s a smart phone, doesn’t mean it’s a smart alarm clock, right? Alarm Day (TM) will be the little savior you need! This clock ticks silently to let you have your deep sleep, but when the time comes, the mini hammer will race back and forth between the two bells, producing loud ringing that will never fail to wake you up. You can even use it in the kitchen as a timer. The built-in nightlight and illuminated hands enable you to see the time perfectly even in the dark. Each part of this 4” clock has been finely crafted into perfection. The solid metal body and the clear front panel will survive the roughest treatments. The whole mechanisms will not stop working after years to come. Also, the vintage design with flower details in the middle will go really well with your room’s decor. Definitely way cuter than any boring digital clock. Click the ‘ADD TO CART’ button now! (c) Alarm Day (TM) – All Rights Reserved Related Searches: Alarm, day, clock, watch, vintage, timeless, stylish, old, girls, girl, dual bell, bell, ringer, ring","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nAQlnZAaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Weiji","source_asin":"B00UITLNDQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UITLNDQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UITLNDQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
