window.products.push({"id":625710,"name":"JMEXSUSS 600 LED Thanksgiving Lights Outdoor, 8 Modes Orange Christmas Lights Plug in, Orange String Lights Clear Wire for Fireplace, House, Yard, Hal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81efWzDNFJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍁【Super Long & Super Bright 】The 168ft thanksgiving outdoor lights with 600 orange LED .You can have an extra-long LED string lights,which is enough to decorated your house in thanksgiving day. It use ultra-high intensity LEDs for smooth，soft and bright lighting to create a delighted, joyful, unique sentimen for Halloween, thanksgiving day, Christmas party, wedding, indoors and outdoors. 🍁【Fall Color Thanksgiving Lights】 The holidays which are associated with orange are Halloween in October and Thanksgiving day in November. So our orange string lights stepped in. How fitting that your family decorate your houses in fall colors lights，such as the orange string lights. Orange light, lots of leaves and turkeys.Wish you a wonderful Thanksgiving Day! 🍁【Safer Use & Child Use】 This Outdoor orange thanksgiving string lights made of 100% copper wire, it will not overheat after long time use. Short-circuit protection design would keep your family safer. The 30V low voltage power adapter passes with UL and CSA certification, no danger of electric shock,make it safe enough for children. Especially when you have little children in your home, this led christmas lights would be your preference. 🍁【8 Modes & Timer & Memory Function 】This outdoor Halloween lights with 8 different light modes: Combination, In waves, Sequential, Slo-Glo, Chasing/Flash, Slow fade, Twinkle/flash and Steady on.Different modes are controlled by the button on the plug, and it will intelligent remember your last choice, no need to reset every time.Our Christmas lights also timing function, which automatically turns on for 6 hours and turns off for 18 hour. 🍁【Durable and Waterproof】Waterproof designed Halloween lights perfect for both indoor and outdoor decorations. Don’t worry about using it in heavy rain and heavy snow. The strong construction makes it tough and sturdy, not easy to break apart and overheat after long hours of usage. They are strong enough to provide years of high quality lighting.Decorate your garden through the bold use of it in whole Halloween and Christmas season. 🍁【Satisfaction】Happy thanksgiving day！！！ Lifetime maintenance. If you have any question about product and service, please feel free to contact us, we will do our best to help you in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81efWzDNFJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JMEXSUSS","source_asin":"B094HV3QTR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094HV3QTR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094HV3QTR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
