window.products.push({"id":625755,"name":"70 Years Birthday 2022 - Wedding Wood Heart Ornament. Happy Couple Party Decoration Supplies. Best Parents 70th Bday Gift Ideas Unique Laser Cut Woode","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M9zhlfpTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It has always been people’s aspiration to catch the enchantment of those sweetest moments of life and encapsulate the memory of the experience in an item that would carry the sentiment into the future. Whether it is that unforgettable trip, that true love or even that sincere friendship, the purity of these moments has given birth to the photographs and the love with which we revisit the past, the wedding ring and the pride with which we carry it or that token of friendship which makes us smile every time we reunite with our closest friends. It is that sentiment our wooden pendant is fit to encapsulate – sculptured in the gentle shape of a heart, enriched with miniature ornaments and polished to perfection. With its precise woodwork, this pendant represents all the qualities that can be ascribed to people’s most beloved moments; from the commitment to persevere with the intricate ornamentation to the reliability of the material… As compact as art figures, go with its 3.95 x 3.5 Inches dimensions our wooden pendant is the token, the talisman that is worthy of encapsulating your favourite memories… From the wedding anniversaries through the class reunions and all the way to the most casual of family meetings, it is the memorabilia that bridge the sweetness of the past with the hope of tomorrow. Get yours now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M9zhlfpTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Party Post","source_asin":"B09NWGSM4V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625755","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NWGSM4V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NWGSM4V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
