window.products.push({"id":625759,"name":"DOMDEC 3-Piece Down Alternative Quilted Comforter Set All Season Reversible Duvet Insert with 2 King Pillow Shams Machine Washable Light Weight(King S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iIZv7vilL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"·★ FLUFFY& YEAR-AROUND WARMTH ★ -Twin 88x68 inches + 1 Standard Sham 21x27 inches； Full/Queen 90x88 inches + 2 Standard Shams 21x27 inches; King 102x90 inches + 2 King Size Shams 21x37 inches ·★MUTI-COLOR OPTIONS★ - Six Reversible colors, Pink Potpourri/Quartz Silver, Quartz Silver/Pebble Grey, Turquoise Sea Green/Twilight Blue, Rose/Beige, Yellow/Grey and Pagoda Blue/Nile Blue ·★ BOX STITCHED DESIGN ★ - The elegant Box stitched design does not only looks decorative but also helps evenly distribute the fiberfill and prevents shifting for maximum durability and deluxe feel. ·★ DOWN ALTERNATIVE FILL ★ - Filled with down alternative fiber, this comforter is exceptionally soft and luxurious and comes with the feature of long lasting comfort. Four-hole high hydrophilic fiber filling technology traps the air and locks-in the warmth. Special 3D hollow staple down alternative fiber provides firmness and durability. Induced with unique foam with ability to float in water makes the comforter extremely comfortable to get the most invigorating sleep. ·★ MACHINE WASHABLE ★ - This Comforter set comes with hydrophilic fiberfill which makes it machine washable & easy to maintain. It's also moisture absorbent and retains the fluffiness of the comforter. Machine Wash Cold, Do Not Bleach, Do Not Iron, Do Not Wring Dry; Tumble Dry Low. Vacuum Sealed Package to freshly preserve and protect it from external elements dust, moisture; perfect for gifting and storage. Once opened, we suggest for a quick fluff to revive comforter's original loft. ·★ PERFECT GIFT & DOMDEC SATISFACTION! ★ - Great gift for family & friends, beautifully packaged with thought and care by yours truly, DOMDEC! We take customers as our top priority and aims to deliver the best products in home and bedding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iIZv7vilL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOMDEC","source_asin":"B0BD6GT36B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD6GT36B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD6GT36B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":625760,"name":"SUMMIT COLLECTION Furrybones Platypus Bill Signature Skeleton in Duck-Billed Platypus Costume with Small Platypus Friend","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715YrMk+0EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Furrybones love costumes to DEATH! A little dead and super cute, they come in all sorts of costumes and always lovingly gazing with their eyes (sockets?!). Which Furrybones suit your fancy? Let them keep you company in your office, by your bed, and in the kitchen. You’ll always find them in their best skeletal smile and are sure to make you smile too. They make great birthday and anniversary gifts! Furrybones Platypus Bill is a resin figurine featuring the signature skeleton dressed up as a duck-billed platypus with a small platypus friend.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715YrMk+0EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUMMIT COLLECTION","source_asin":"B00K5BHVH4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00K5BHVH4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00K5BHVH4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
