window.products.push({"id":625798,"name":"Typhoon Vintage-Kitchen Cake Tin, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xcFrHAheL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Typhoon?: Providing design led kitchenware at affordable prices. The Typhoon? Red Cake Tin comes in a full-bodied finish that is sure to be as pleasing to the eyes as the tin's contents will be to the taste buds. The flavor is preserved by the air tight silicone seal which locks in freshness while shunning dust, air and humidity. The color coated steel body makes it a tough and lasting piece of kitchen equipment while the vintage design speaks volumes of the owner's great taste in kitchen d?cor. Measures 5-1/4-Inches high by 9-1/2-Inches in diameter. The Vintage Kitchen range evokes memories of our grandparents kitchens. Practical details like airtight seals for Storage Canisters, carbon filters to keep the Compost Caddy smelling sweet and clever place-markers for the Recipe Book Stand, ensure that this range is definitely not old fashioned. Made from high quality coated steel resulting in a smooth, silky finish. All items of the range have been designed to be durable for every day use. Starting as a small company with a simple philosophy, to bring Asian products to a British market, Typhoon? has chartered the waters of homewares in the UK and beyond. One thing on their journey has always remained the same and is at the heart of everything they do... Design led kitchenware at affordable prices. Simple!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xcFrHAheL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SmileMore","source_asin":"B000IWR198","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000IWR198","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000IWR198","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
