window.products.push({"id":625801,"name":"NAO Jewel of The Sea. Porcelain Mermaid Figure.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":180.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51j4SyvZPOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Nao porcelain sculptures are hand crafted in Valencia, Spain where pioneers in the European porcelain industry have been creating timeless works of art since the company's inception in 1953. This blend of old-world craftsmanship and the latest ceramic technology ensures that each individual Nao sculpture is finished to perfection and will be cherished for generations to come. Nao's extensive collection of more than 300 sculptures captures the unforgettable moments of life including motherhood, weddings, childhood, falling in love, the joy of pets, the beauty of nature, religion and much more. Both gift-givers and discriminating collectors alike will appreciate the quality and attention to detail that signifies each and every Nao sculpture. Nao, part of the Lladro group, is sold in more than 122 countries around the world. Amazon.com The lovely young mermaid in Nao's Sounds of the Sea figurine quietly admires a shiny pearl while the sea breeze blows through her hair. Just a child, the mermaid has a sweet and innocent air, accentuated by her starfish jewelry and soft expression. Made from fine porcelain in Spain's famous Lladro studios, the piece is crafted and painted by hand for exquisite coloring and detail. Individual scales on the fish tail are well defined, and the features of the child's face are clear but delicate. A glossy glaze overall adds a subtle gleam and provides a protective coat. Stamped with the Nao seal on its underside, the sculpture measures approximately 8-1/4 inches high. Nao also makes a coordinating mermaid figurine called Sounds of the Sea. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51j4SyvZPOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NAO","source_asin":"B0001WW302","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625801","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001WW302","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001WW302","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
