window.products.push({"id":625833,"name":"Morden Fort Modern 2 Pieces of Chair and Sofa Couch Set with Dutch Velvet Blue,Iron Legs.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1029.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Zsuik2vvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Dimension】Chair: 38.5\" x 30\" x 34\", Sofa: 85\" x 35\" x 34\" , It is too big to be sent in one package, in order to prevent carrier's occupational injury. Therefore, it has been divided into 6 packages and may be delivered on different dates. 【Modern Transitional】This Retro-chair combines Gothic punk and contemporary shapes flawlessly, bringing out a unique luxurious look. Its design is sure to catch the eye and add a touch of sophistication to any interior home décor. 【Superb Material】LUXURIOUS DUTCH VELVET UPHOLSTERY, the distinct plush of this velvet creates a rich and luxurious feel. 【Cozy and Long-lasting】Seat cushions filled with high resilience foam and polyester fiber wadding provide comfortable, Overstuffed construction for extra comfort and longevity. 【Sturdy and Craftsmanship】Constructed with a superb wood frame, this chair is sturdy and durable. Every step of the sofa-making process focuses on perfection, resulting in an almost exacting level of craftsmanship. 【NOTED】Our return policy is within 30 days of the purchase day, if you are returning items because of manufacturer defect or damaged item we will provide full return and replacement. However , if you are returning because order was placed wrong, do not like color, or have a change in mind, you will be responsible for covering all return fees.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Zsuik2vvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Morden Fort","source_asin":"B0BMK7RN1X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMK7RN1X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMK7RN1X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":625834,"name":"AOYOO Christmas Tree Topper Lighted Star Top Topper with LED Rotating Snowflake Projector Lights | 3D Magic Glitter Snow Projection for Home Indoor Ou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817ILwiSS6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎅🎄【UNIQUE XMAS STAR TREE TOPPER】Hollow 3D Star tree topper design with 180° rotatable LED projector lamp inside. The frame of the star tree topper is added with glitter powder material, which is very delicate and shiny, adding sparkling light to your Christmas tree decorations, The built-in magic led rotating projector can project a gorgeous snowflake effect. You can turn the built-in projector to adjust the direction of the projection light. 🎅🎉【2-IN-1 XMAS TREE TOPPER & SNOWFLAKE PROJECTOR LIGHT】This 3D hollow design Star-shaped tree topper built-in magic LED rotating projector, it will project many floating snowflakes onto your ceiling, clear and bright, and increase the Christmas atmosphere, making your Christmas unique. Not only suitable for Christmas but also as an LED night light projector for children. 🎅🌲【PROJECTION RANGE】Tree Topper size: 10*10*3.94 inch / 25.4*25.4*10 cm, wire length: 118inch / 300cm. You can get different projection effects by adjusting the distance and direction of the LED projection. The farther from the ceiling, the larger the projection range. Distance to ceiling 3ft, projection range is 2*3ft; Distance to ceiling 4ft, projection range is 3*4ft. 🎅🌟【WIDE APPLICATION & SAFTY】This Christmas tree topper snowflake is suitable for Christmas trees of different sizes, and it has passed international UL certification, please rest assured to use it. This shining lighted treetop will be perfect for decorating in Christmas party, shopping center, home, park, garden, yard, cafe, pub, bistro, bar, restaurant, office, supermarket, shopping mall, hotel, Halloween, Thanksgiving, New Year, birthday party, wedding, anniversary, ceremony, evening party. 🎅🎁【WARM CHRISTMAS GIFT】 This XMAS tree topper is a Christmas gift that everyone likes. The beautiful gift box is full of a festive atmosphere, suitable for family and friends, especially for children! According to the color of your Christmas tree, we have two colors of gold and silver snowflakes tree topper for you to choose from, they will be the perfect Christmas combination. It can also be used as an ideal choice for children's rotating LED night light projectors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817ILwiSS6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AOYOO","source_asin":"B099MSXDQD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625834","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099MSXDQD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099MSXDQD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
