window.products.push({"id":625841,"name":"Truweigh Mini Crimson Digital Scale - (100g x 0.01g Black/Red) -Digital Kitchen Scale with Bowl - Digital Travel Scale - Portable Food Scale - Meal Pr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k+HJSl9rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Truweigh is a leader in the kitchen food scale industry, with a wide range in scales for every market, we have a pocket scale to fit every need. The MINI CRIMSON bowl scale 100g x 0.01g is known for high precision and accuracy making this a top of the line meal prep scale. All Truweigh food weight scales come with a 10 year limited warranty protecting your purchase. The MINI CRIMSON digital mini scale includes a collapsible silicone bowl and latching cover for incredible versatility that is microwavable, oven and freezer safe. The silicone bowl contains and protects the digital kitchen scale when collapsed, keeping it safe from knocks and bumps. When fully expanded, the bowl provides a comfortably large volume for you to weigh your items in that fits perfectly on your digital food scale. Our Truweigh MINI CRIMSON travel food scale ships to you pre-calibrated but we suggest purchasing one of our 100g calibration weights to keep your measurements accurate over time. Our portable scale comes with built-in overload protection to help prevent long term damage to your powder scale. The food grade silicone collapsible bowl can withstand heat up to 600 degrees allowing you to weigh your food on your electronic kitchen scale and then place the bowl right into the oven to cook. The Truweigh MINI CRIMSON baking scale has a max capacity of 100g and a readability of 0.01g making this a high accuracy scale. It also comes with our in-depth instruction manual to make sure you utilize all features that come with our Truweigh MINI CRIMSON herb scale. With two weighing platforms, Silicone Bowl or the plastic case, use either option that fits your weighing needs. Truweigh also included two AAA batteries, making our jewelry scale ready to use as soon as you receive it. The Truweigh MINI CRIMSON digital weight scale crosses over as the most versatile counter top scale on the market. It can be used as a scale for packages, reloading equipment, soap making supplies, scale for food, travel scale, resin scale for DIY projects, meat scale, gold scale, and much more. With impeccable accuracy trust in Truweigh to help make sure your next meal or at home DIY project is finished with precision and accurate weights. It easily convert between: G / OZ / OZT / DWT / CT / GN","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k+HJSl9rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Truweigh","source_asin":"B08M8ZGYM8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625841","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M8ZGYM8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M8ZGYM8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
