window.products.push({"id":625855,"name":"Honeywell HY254E QuietSet Tower Fan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mTmpBq3FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Quiet is one of the important features in a fan as many people want to be cool while they are trying to go to sleep. The Honeywell HY108E1 QuietSet Tower Fan has eight levels of quiet control for continuous comfort, including a sleep setting and also a white noise setting which can be used as an aid to get to sleep- blocking out distracting inconsistent sounds. The adjustable thermostat means you can set the fan to the desired temperature and the fan will automatically speed up/slow down to reach its target. There is also an option to set a timer so the fan will automatically set off after 1, 2, 4 or 8 hours. Digital display (displays room temperature in Fahrenheit), remote control, oscillation and space saving design make a premium fan for the summer. Set Contains: 1 x Quiet Set Tower Fan","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mTmpBq3FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honeywell","source_asin":"B010TKPM1C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010TKPM1C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010TKPM1C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":625856,"name":"Mastrad Deco Veggie-Slicer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZwhkqpAPL._AC_SL1093_.jpg","description":"Knowing exactly what you are consuming is part of a health-conscious lifestyle. The Mastrad Deco Veggie-Slicer will make it breeze for you to make add more vegetables to your healthy routine. Ingenious in design, the 3-in-1 Slicer features 3 different sized blades---slice ribbon cuts, or small or medium juliennes. Use the thinly sliced veggies to garnish appetizers, add vegetables to salads, or replace carbohydrate-loaded pasta with noodle-like julienned carrots or zucchini. the possibilities are endless. Included is a finger guard to protect hand while slicing and ensuring you are able to use every last piece of vegetable without any waste. Each piece stacks together for convenient storage. Dishwasher safe. Mastrad helps you achieve your healthy goals with ingenious bake ware, tools and gadgets that make it possible to cook in a healthier way.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZwhkqpAPL._AC_SL1093_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mastrad","source_asin":"B00HD7GM3C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HD7GM3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HD7GM3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
