window.products.push({"id":625872,"name":"Sous vide cooker+Vacuum Sealer+Vacuum Sealer bags Rolls (11\"x 50') 2 rolls","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-4fkCDZOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The combination of sous vides cooker, vacuum sealer and vacuum sealer bags rolls is very suitable for healthy cooking. The reasons are as follows： First of all, KitchenFun Vacuum Sealer Bags is made of multi-layer food-grade material, which is 4 Mils thick and BPA free. It is very safe for food storage, and durable and strong enough to avoid sharp bones puncturing. One side embossed dotted pattern design and the other side smooth design, ensuring maximum air extraction and good sealing. By using KitchenFun Vacuum Sealer Bags you can keep food fresh up to 5 times longer. Secondly, KitchenFun Vacuum Sealer uses a multifunctional 4 buttons design, corresponding to 4 multi sealing modes. Provides accurate sealing choices and the best preservation for your food. Double seal detection design: after KitchenFun vacuum sealer removing all the air, this food vacuum sealer will perform a pumping test again to ensure that the sealing mouth fully meets the standard. Finally, KitchenFun Sous Vide Cooker is1100 watts with a thermal immersion circulator and powerful brushless DC motor, which heat the water fast to the precise temperature and ensuring that the same temperature of every part of the cooking water! Wild range of temperature104°F-194°F (40°C- 90°C) make KitchenFun sous vide precision cooker retain more nutrients and vitamins than other cooking methods.KitchenFun sous vide immersion cooker can perfectly cook any food of your choosing, like beef, chicken, pork, seafood, pasta, egg, baking, salad and much more. You can refer to the following steps when using this healthy cooking combination： Step 1: Cut the desired length of KitchenFun vacuum sealer bags rolls based on foods. Step 2: Vacuum and seal foods accordingly with KitchenFun vacuum sealer. Step 3: Cook the sealed foods with KitchenFun sous vide cooker. Step 4: Enjoy healthy foods when KitchenFun sous vide cooking cycle is finished.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-4fkCDZOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenFun","source_asin":"B09BFG3PTF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625872","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BFG3PTF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BFG3PTF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
