window.products.push({"id":625888,"name":"Momiji Premium Reusable Grocery Shopping Bags, Unique European Artists, Certified Recycled Polyester, Set of 2 Bags, Foldable, Eco-Friendly, Machine W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815nD54cAXL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Momiji Polyester Reusable Shopping Bags - Adorable and Eco-Friendly The only foldable shopping bags made from certified recycled polyester Does anyone really like plastic bags? They're small, bland, rip underweight, and are a strain on the environment. But now you can break free from plastic with Momiji's reusable shopping bag. Made with strong recycled polyester, our reusable grocery bag set measures 19.7 inches by 15.7 inches each and can hold up to 55 pounds without tearing or threatening the integrity of the craftsmanship. When you want to put it away, it folds down to an amazingly compact size of 5.9 by 5.5 inches - small enough to fit into your pocket, purse, handbag, or glove compartment. We've also collaborated with an incredible artist to give our foldable bags for groceries a glamorous, fun look aesthetic. You'll love the way your grocery shopping tote bags looks, and you'll have peace of mind knowing that you're helping the environment by cutting back on wasteful plastic bags. Your order comes with two grocery tote bags (each brandishing its own design) in luxurious packaging. There's no need for additional gift wrap when giving these shopping tote bag sets as presents. So make the responsible choice and switch to Momiji reusable totes today! About Wendy Kendall ' I'm a freelance surface pattern designer based in Staffordshire, UK. After graduating from the University of Derby, I worked as a home textiles designer for several UK companies based in the North West. My work has featured in Flow magazine Germany and Molly Makes magazine' Product Details (2) Grocery Shopping Bags with Handles Bag Size (Unfolded, with Handles): 19.7 in. x 15.7 in. Materials: Polyester Colors/Designs: Yorkshire Terrier on viola and orange white background Washing Instructions: Machine wash below 113 degrees Fahrenheit","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815nD54cAXL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Momiji","source_asin":"B09SLR9FSY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625888","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SLR9FSY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SLR9FSY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":625889,"name":"Novogratz by Momeni Indio 100% Wool Hand Made Contemporary Area Rug, 7'6\" X 9'6\", Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":124.84,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91d8bCi5uaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Southwestern-style influences within this handmade area rug collection makes interior floors instantly feel like home. Artful detailing throughout each floorcovering honors the legacy of tribal handicrafts using a distinctive combination of cut and looped wool fibers to define each exotic geometric pattern. Repeating diamond shapes, stripes, triangles and pyramids get a burst of boho chic in shades of pastel pink, sky blue, gray and gold with shaggy accents that emphasize the high-low profile and textural variation underfoot. A signature addition to the Novogratz by Momeni collection, each rug reflects the brand’s commitment to creating boutique-worthy home accents with an eclectic attitude that’s accessible for everyday living.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91d8bCi5uaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Momeni","source_asin":"B07JCBSHQH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-625889","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JCBSHQH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JCBSHQH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
